            "text": "+1.5°C is now considered unavoidable.\n\nThe latest UNEP report shows even the most optimistic scenario reaching 1.8°C.\n\nThe priority now: keep the overshoot as low and short as possible. But this also raises urgent questions of justice: who decides what is protected, rebuilt or left behind?"
